From 8187ad7e9efa8b1c96ba4ae78be3113aa7b23012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:44:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] treble_app: modernise settings ui, material 3 theming
 and switch styling

modernise settings UI by migrating to MainSettingsFragment, removing
deprecated API usages and resolving compile warnings across the codebase.

add Material 3 theming with dynamic colour support, back navigation icons
and updated activity layouts for Settings and Updater.

set the status bar colour to match the window surface in the app theme.

convert preferences across all device setting screens to SwitchPreference
and style switches with the Material 3 switch widget style.
